module gooo_grammar_capability_evidence

input query
input source_digest
input grammar_digest
input capability_digest
input report_digest
input evidence_digest
input first_mismatch
input missing_stage

status BOUND query, source, grammar, capability, and report evidence are linked
status DEFERRED query or grammar evidence is unresolved
status UNKNOWN source or report evidence is missing

field status
field query_digest
field source_digest
field grammar_digest
field capability_digest
field report_digest
field evidence_digest
field first_mismatch
field missing_stage

constraint query_evidence_is_bound
constraint source_grammar_capability_chain
constraint evidence_digest_is_derived
constraint unknown_preserves_first_boundary
constraint deferred_preserves_missing_stage
constraint no_program_execution
constraint read_only
